1
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:05,522
People can ask what you hold on them.

2
00:00:05,522 --> 00:00:08,038
Open the customer and scroll to Privacy.

3
00:00:08,038 --> 00:00:12,250
Download data gives you a file with everything the store holds on them,

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,329
to send to the person who asked.

5
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:20,178
Erase personal data removes their name, email, phone and addresses, and the personal

6
00:00:20,178 --> 00:00:21,976
details of their orders.

7
00:00:21,976 --> 00:00:26,887
The orders themselves stay, because your accounts and tax records need them.

8
00:00:27,341 --> 00:00:29,530
Let's erase Avery Stone.

9
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:32,814
Click Erase personal data, and confirm.

10
00:00:32,814 --> 00:00:34,711
It cannot be undone.

11
00:00:35,173 --> 00:00:40,673
The customer now says that their personal data was erased, and can no longer be edited.

12
00:00:40,673 --> 00:00:46,233
Each download and erasure is listed under Privacy, with when it happened and who did it.

